<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of Ayudhya rated sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of Ayudhya rated sell.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Plus Securities Co Ltd recommended on Thursday that investors sell shares of medium-sized Bank of Ayudhya on concerns that its earnings would continue to be under pressure in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Keys to BAY's earnings will be the ability to maintain NIM (net interest margin) and the amount of provisioning set aside. EPS (earning per share) growth will be diluted by last year's rights issue,&quot; it said in a report.</p>
</text>
